1
00:00:03,174 --> 00:00:07,192
A contact joins an account with the Account picker on its editor.

2
00:00:07,192 --> 00:00:10,474
Open a contact and choose the account from the list.

3
00:00:12,124 --> 00:00:14,547
Opportunities have the same picker.

4
00:00:14,547 --> 00:00:19,334
Every contact and opportunity type can join an account without extra setup.

5
00:00:19,334 --> 00:00:21,343
Leads never join an account:

6
00:00:21,343 --> 00:00:23,884
they get one when they are converted.

